<div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-5 sm:px-8 py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="dots-orange absolute inset-0 opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-lg w-full text-center space-y-8">
    <p class="font-display font-light text-[clamp(6rem,22vw,12rem)] leading-none select-none" style="color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--orange)" aria-hidden="true">500</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Terjadi <em class="italic text-orange">kesalahan.</em></h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-soft leading-relaxed max-w-sm mx-auto">
      Sesuatu tidak berjalan sebagaimana mestinya di sisi server. Silakan coba lagi beberapa saat kemudian.
    </p>
    <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
      <p class="text-xs text-blued font-mono bg-tint border border-blue/30 rounded p-4 break-words text-left"><%= error %></p>
    <% } %>
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-ink text-paper px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm hover:bg-blue transition-colors duration-300">← kembali ke beranda</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
